{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c1a6fa510f28ba8c4a2ee2756befb927f68de9889742984055f1c93b886012d3","ja":"みんな、お疲れさまー。","zh":"大家辛苦啦——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"306a0f223a9f2c41981328a1947c43bc24b2a436e06deab849af602780274abd","ja":"あら？　このみさん、その本……\nもしかして、今度のお仕事に関する物でしょうか～？","zh":"哎呀？　木实小姐，那本书……\n难道说，和下次的工作有关吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9115839df22fbc416a99320641bb417940096c63fd406fb695a6a501572443ea","ja":"ええ、星座にまつわる神話の本を買ってみたの！\nせっかくのコラボだから勉強したくて♪","zh":"嗯，我买了一本关于星座神话的书！\n难得有这次联动，所以想好好了解一下♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5efba3547eaef3a880f65c959cdde2550c865a422ea938a0ea818fe3811e15d4","ja":"私たちの映画『アイドルスペースウォーズ』と、\nプラネタリウムのコラボイベントですね。","zh":"是我们的电影《偶像太空战争》\n与天文馆的联动活动呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"be7c17897eb3fc843ee57d96b35fe996de2ce76a3bc1f382fb55d36f426289a1","ja":"プラネタリウムで、星座にまつわる物語の\nナレーションをするのでしたよね。","zh":"是在天文馆为星座相关的故事\n做旁白对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4668d11a2768f5b4418629f86f35da9f298a8276b700dee4e6cf43ff53a848f8","ja":"あたしもこのみさんみたいに、\n星座のこと調べてみようかなぁ。","zh":"我也像木实姐那样，\n去查查星座的事情吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"86f6640121b90b78ba0c7a86d13f75ab2901c2228a3c88990e94e2f78c95c74f","ja":"きっとお仕事の参考になるわよ♪　読み終わったら\nみんなにもこの本、貸してあげるわね！","zh":"一定会对工作有所参考的哦♪　等你看完了，\n我也会把这本书借给大家的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"5a931059d52d01b54b320824050bb366c685f5a69d69afa00de0f7cbd050505c","ja":"アンドロメダのお話……魅惑のプリンセス！\nな感じで、とっても素敵だったのです♪","zh":"仙女座的故事……很有魅惑公主的感觉，\n真的太棒了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"3158110c638677b387c0c46fc3484d09eb6faf3bf273a640d2f70a262a52811c","ja":"最後にはハッピーエンドで終わるのも\nよかったかと。","zh":"最后以团圆结局收尾也\n挺不错的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"ec035ac1f10bc50e6f5fa3f220c5e6087e8973eed6b4ee7b1d736f7108d1bb8f","ja":"他のお話も、神様がなんだか人間らしくて、\n楽しく読むことができました。","zh":"其他故事里的神明也总觉得颇有人情味，\n读起来十分有趣。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"751220bd06dcbdf1a82fbab5f406203dbea2186413e04d634f9a4b874f3921dc","ja":"星座のお話って、面白いものが多いわよね～。\nそういえば、ひなたちゃんも熱心に調べてたわよね？","zh":"星座的故事有很多都挺有趣的呢～。\n话说回来，日向好像也很热心地查过资料吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"dbc888e0b3061b04c2f87c5a4bcf76354885e796c122a0f6d9e2f6cc2ddcfffa","ja":"うん。あたしの担当するナレーションにねぇ、\nこと座が出てくるから、勉強してみたんだぁ……。","zh":"嗯。我负责的旁白里呀，\n提到了天琴座，所以就试着学了一下呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"3ee1953384266b89ed09bb72d955115b63e62f2f3cd4bb737c7ec56b66667989","ja":"したっけ、なまら悲しいお話でね……。\n……うぅ。","zh":"然后啊，是个特别悲伤的故事呢……\n……呜呜。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1233.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"ba24c2e98e0a133cb126905579aa93c1e20cf8efd8dc6ba663ac61df5f9854e1","ja":"……ひなたちゃん、大丈夫ですか？","zh":"……日向，你没事吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
